{
    "background_story": "Amy was a free-spirited adventurer who lived life on her own terms. As a professional rock climber, she spent most of her days scaling vertical walls and conquering seemingly insurmountable peaks. But Amy's true passion was flying - she was an avid pilot with a penchant for aerobatics. One day, while performing a particularly tricky maneuver, Amy's seatbelt jammed, threatening to trap her in the cockpit. With her quick thinking and calm demeanor, she managed to unbuckle the stuck harness and escape the plane just in time. The incident only added to her legend, earning her the nickname 'The Unbuckled Aviatrix' among her peers. Amy's fearlessness and ability to stay focused under pressure inspired countless others to push beyond their limits.",
